# Intermediate results
*.csv
*.tsv

# Except the supplementary tables: three revision scripts and
# verify_numbers.py read the cohort and signature definitions out of
# them, so the repository is not runnable without them. 60 KB in total.
!05_Manuscript/04_Tables/*.csv


# the panel manifest. verify_panel_provenance.py ships and reads it, and it is
# the only translation between a directory name like 05_I and the panel letter
# actually printed. 41 KB.
!03_Final_Panels/PROVENANCE.csv

# the derived tables ship_panel_inputs() copies in for the panels that read a
# small table sitting beside them: a correlation matrix, five Jaccard matrices,
# two GSEA summaries, the MoMac marker summary, the two NF-kB ranking tables
# and the liver/stomach per-sample table. 216 KB in total. Every one is
# cell-state x cell-state or gene-level summary statistics; none carries a
# specimen identifier.
!03_Final_Panels/04_Figure_4/04_A/correlation_matrix.csv
!03_Final_Panels/04_Figure_4/04_A/module_mappings.csv
!03_Final_Panels/04_Figure_4/04_B/Module_1_jaccard_matrix.csv
!03_Final_Panels/04_Figure_4/04_B/Module_2_jaccard_matrix.csv
!03_Final_Panels/04_Figure_4/04_B/Module_3_jaccard_matrix.csv
