!03_Final_Panels/10_Supplementaries/S2_CEACAM_Metaprogram_Validation/data_prep/liver_stomach_ceacam_per_sample.csv

# revision-analysis outputs that a SHIPPED script in the same module reads back,
# found by check_clean_checkout.py. 213 KB in total; all are aggregate
# statistics - per gene, per cell state or per specification - and the two
# per-sample tables carry the published study sample IDs only. The other 819
# CSV and TSV files under 04_Revision_Analyses/ stay ignored.
!04_Revision_Analyses/08_R2.1_PreTx_Inflammatory/outputs/pretx_signature_scores.csv
!04_Revision_Analyses/08_R2.1_PreTx_Inflammatory/outputs/pretx_state_abundance.csv
